repo_flow_graph:
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[User Interaction] --> B(Input: Numbers, Operators);
    B --> C{Calculator.py};
    C --> D[Evaluate Expression];
    D --> E{Error Handling};
    E -- Valid Result --> F(Output: Result);
    E -- Invalid Input --> G[Error Message];
    C -- Uses --> H[Utils.py: Helper Functions (e.g., precedence, tokenize)];
    H --> I(Input: Expression);
    I --> J(Tokenized Expression);
    J --> K(Precedence Rules);
    K --> L(Output: Evaluated Value);
    L --> D;
    F --> M[Display Result];
    G --> N[Display Error];
    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style C fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style H fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style F fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style G fill:#fcc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
```

file_flow_graph.diagram:
```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Start: index.js] --> B{Event Listener (DOMContentLoaded)};
    B -- Yes --> C[Get elements from DOM (display, buttons)];
    C --> D{Add event listeners to buttons};
    D --> E[Button click event];
    E --> F{Event target (button value)};
    F --> G{Value is "="(equals)}
    G -- Yes --> H{Try {Evaluate expression on display} catch {Error}};
    H -- Success --> I[Update display with result];
    H -- Error --> J[Display "Error"];
    G -- No --> K{Value is "AC"(Clear)}
    K -- Yes --> L[Clear display];
    K -- No --> M{Value is "DEL"(Delete)}
    M -- Yes --> N[Remove last character from display];
    M -- No --> O[Append value to display];
    O --> P[Update display with current value];
    N --> Q[Update display with current value];
    I --> R[End];
    J --> R[End];
    L --> R[End];
    Q --> R[End];
    P --> R[End];

    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style H fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
```
